sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Huang et al. (2004, 2010) & Pinto & Ermentrout (2001) neocortical spiral wave dynamics & phase singularity topology faithfully reproduces Rattus norvegicus / Homo sapiens tangential neocortical sheet (Layers III-V) morphology" ;
        dcterms:description "The simulation script(s) 2013-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Rattus norvegicus / Homo sapiens tangential neocortical sheet (Layers III-V) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.8/100, audit 2026-10-19-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2013-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2013-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals.py; output: docs/media/corticothalamic_seizure_spirals_comparison.png; organism: Rattus norvegicus / Homo sapiens tangential neocortical sheet (Layers III-V); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 8e19f210a705689fed055999b0cf4bc7b4186b66538d2729cc57db348f32af80; artifact_sha256: 5fb972407a691858f812d1fa73ce5ccaef68c4e650f1b3ca25af546cc7dce725; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/corticothalamic_seizure_spirals/corticothalamic_seizure_spirals_reference.json=3570a9b466035f9e..., datasets/corticothalamic_seizure_spirals/paper_citations.bib=2ea747169ffdca2a..., datasets/corticothalamic_seizure_spirals/rat_neocortical_tangential_sheet_specimen.jpg=c4fdfb27cd39c842..., datasets/corticothalamic_seizure_spirals/scout_manifest.json=e31d28291faa189a...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Huang et al. (2004, 2010) J. Neurosci. voltage-sensitive dye recordings in tangential slices of Rattus norvegicus neocortex demonstrating self-sustained 8-15 Hz theta/alpha rotating spiral waves with radial speed 30-80 mm/s and sharp amplitude reduction A(x_core) -> 0 at the topological phase singularity | Pinto & Ermentrout (2001) SIAM J. Appl. Math. 62:206-225 excitatory-adaptation neural field equations tau_u du/dt = -u + F(w_ee K_e * u - g_a a + I_ext), tau_a da/dt = -a + u governing cortical wave propagation speed and wavelength scaling with horizontal axonal footprint sigma_e | Townsend et al. (2015) J. Neurosci. 35:4657-4662 & Huang et al. (2004) Fig. 4 nucleation of counter-rotating figure-eight spiral pairs (W_+ = +1, W_- = -1, sum W_i = 0) from broken planar wave fronts and suppression by CNQX/AMPA glutamatergic blockade; reconstructed_in_script: 2D Wilson-Cowan / Pinto-Ermentrout excitatory-adaptation neural field PDE solver on a 64x64 (6.0 x 6.0 mm) tangential sheet with 2D FFT Gaussian axonal footprint convolution, state-space phase map phi(x,y,t), and automatic 2x2 plaquette winding number tracker across all 6 regimes | Automated DoG CV segmentation of N=110 tangential cortical barrel columns (mean inter-column spacing 266.8 um) and 50-bin radial cytochrome-oxidase optical density profile (r=0.9965) on rat_neocortical_tangential_sheet_specimen.jpg; transfer_boundary: Normalized excitatory population firing activity u(x,t) in [0,1] and slow adaptation recovery a(x,t) mapped onto the 6x6 mm tangential cortical sheet with 1 ms integration steps; does_not_claim: Full 6-layer vertical Hodgkin-Huxley compartmental dendritic conductances or thalamocortical relay bursting channels]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1137/S0036139900346453>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1523/JNEUROSCI.2547-10.2010>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1523/JNEUROSCI.2705-04.2004>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1523/JNEUROSCI.4657-14.2015> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.928"^^xsd:double .

    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2013-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals.py> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
